# Agrus Kos's enter trigger can target Agrus Kos himself (any creature): Bot1 suspects him on turn 1 (menace, can't block). On turn 3 his attack trigger targets him again; he is suspected, so he is exiled
# (the choice is checked as the ability resolves) before combat damage, and Bot2 takes none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Suspected = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice.Keywords = CantBlock; DoubleStrike; Menace; Vigilance
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Agrus Kos, Spirit of Justice
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby
